    "name": "Antediluvian: Seed in Peril",
    "steam_appid": 3094760,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Antediluvian: Seed in Peril&quot; starts as a Roguelite that takes place in a world full of hungry Nephilim giants, vicious hybridized creatures, and enemies of a paranormal nature.\u00a0 The beautiful Naamah has been captured and imprisoned by the confused populace of Atlantis, intending to sacrifice her to one of the few surviving titans.\u00a0 Time is running out, and Noah must act swiftly to save his true love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey as Noah through the land and collect all of the Sigils of Creation.\u00a0 Harness their supernatural abilities and wield their strength to rescue Naamah from the mouth of the titan.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Antediluvian: Seed in Peril&quot; starts as a Roguelite that takes place in a world full of hungry Nephilim giants, vicious hybridized creatures, and enemies of a paranormal nature.\u00a0 The beautiful Naamah has been captured and imprisoned by the confused populace of Atlantis, intending to sacrifice her to one of the few surviving titans.\u00a0 Time is running out, and Noah must act swiftly to save his true love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey as Noah through the land and collect all of the Sigils of Creation.\u00a0 Harness their supernatural abilities and wield their strength to rescue Naamah from the mouth of the titan.</p>",
    "short_description": "Journey through a land of hungry giants, collect all of the Sigils of Creation, and use their supernatural abilities to rescue your bride Naamah from becoming titan food.",
